              <img src="/screens/matches.webp" width="1600" height="1007" alt="The Matches screen: a scored list of jobs on the left, the selected job's details, AI analysis and full description on the right.">
            </div>
            <p class="sc1-cap">Matches &mdash; the shortlist, newest first, with the full posting and the AI's reasoning beside it.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="sc1-facts">
            <div class="sc1-fact"><span class="chip chip-score">87</span><p>Every job scored 0&ndash;100 against your own profile.</p></div>
            <div class="sc1-fact"><span class="chip chip-strong">Strong</span><p>Pros and cons written out. Disagree? Change the verdict.</p></div>
            <div class="sc1-fact"><span class="chip chip-applied">Applied</span><p>Mark what you sent, so nothing gets applied to twice.</p></div>
            <div class="sc1-fact">
              <div class="sc1-co">
                <img src="/screens/company.webp" width="66" height="66" alt="">
                <b>Freenow by Lyft</b>
                <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg>
              </div>
              <p>Click the company for its size, whether it's an agency, everything else it has posted, and your notes on it.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sc1-fact"><span class="chip chip-note">Notes</span><p>Your own notes, saved against the job.</p></div>
