          <p><strong>What does it cost?</strong> Bring your own Apify and OpenAI keys, or ask me for credits. Spend from <b>~$5/month</b> in your tokens.</p>
          <p><strong>Is it safe to use my keys?</strong> Your keys are stored and used only for your runs. Or you could self-host from GitHub.</p>
